---
import C from "../components/C.astro";
import CodeCard from "../components/CodeCard.astro";
import P from "../components/P.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
---

<Section id="styling" title="Hover and focus">
  <P>
    A fake cursor can't trigger <C>:hover</C>, and playthru never moves real keyboard focus, so it can't trigger{" "}
    <C>:focus</C> either. Instead it marks the element under the cursor and the field being typed in.
  </P>
  <CodeCard
    title="app.css"
    lang="css"
    code={`.button:hover,\n.button[data-playthru-hover] {\n  background: var(--button-hover);\n}\n\ninput[data-playthru-focus] {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);\n}`}
  />
  <P>
    In Tailwind, the attributes work as variants: <C>hover:bg-gray-200 data-playthru-hover:bg-gray-200</C>. The text caret
    is drawn by playthru, in the field's own text color.
  </P>
</Section>
